{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-the-lana-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"the-lana-residences-omniyat-business-bay","about":"The Lana Residences, Dorchester Collection is an exceptional luxury development by Dubai’s visionary developer, Omniyat, located in the prestigious Marasi Bay. The project comprises two elegantly interconnected towers resting on a grand podium. One tower is home to a world-class hotel, while the other features an exclusive selection of high-end residences—including 2 to 4-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom duplexes, and 4- to 5-bedroom penthouses with private Jacuzzis and expansive terraces. The podium level is dedicated to upscale cafés, fine dining restaurants, and leisure amenities reserved solely for residents.Designed in collaboration with the renowned Parisian design house Gilles &amp; Boissier, the architecture and interiors of The Lana Residences exude timeless sophistication. The façade and interior spaces are adorned with premium materials, elegant finishes, and bespoke design details. Each residence is thoughtfully crafted with flowing layouts, private balconies or terraces, and custom-designed furniture in light, natural tones—creating an atmosphere of refined calm and understated luxury.As part of the iconic Dorchester Collection, The Lana Residences at Business Bay delivers an unmatched lifestyle experience. Residents enjoy access to a curated selection of five-star hotel services, including dedicated concierge, 24-hour security with surveillance, valet parking, housekeeping, and butler service. World-class amenities include a modern fitness centre, yoga studio, tranquil spa, outdoor swimming pool, and lush landscaped gardens.","price":85000000,"title":"The Lana Residences","bitrix":{"id":466,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"The Lana Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Lana Residences","property_type":"Apa